==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|pulmōnārius||of the lungs}}, from {{m|la|pulmō||lung}} + {{m|la|-ārius}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*pléu-mon-}}. Cognate with Greek {{m|el|πλεμόνι}}, French {{m|fr|poumon}}, Lithuanian {{m|lt|plauciai}}, Polish {{m|pl|płuco}} and Russian {{m|ru|пла́вать||to swim}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Pertaining to, having, or affecting the [[lung]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[pneumonic]]
* [[pulmonic]]

